{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52788","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 李彦和","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遗荣辞上国，解印适稽山。\n圣主流深眷，羣公祖别颜。\n彩帆收监水，紫气度函关。\n应是辽阳鹤，千年始一还。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李彦和","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52788.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52788","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}